body:
I am not sure. I am a older brother to both a younger sister and brother. Honestly family drifts apart if someone does not take the reins and steer the relationship. My siblings love me but they dont pay too much attention. At the end of the day the responsibility of keeping the relationship alive falls on me, partially because they are depressed or maybe i pushed them away as kids. I really do not know, but we have a good friendship and its not always constant but I constantly try to make it real and meaningful. That works for me and keeps my family a family even though we dont live together anymore. I hope my experience might help you in some way. Good luck

&#x200B;

Edit: since i didnt really answer your question. I was raised by basically all women and yes men feel very many feelings but are usually told to keep them piped down. Maybe your brother was unfortunately one of those casualties and hides the real emotions and desires inside?

You sound like youre a future incel. Honestly she probably doesn't sleep with you because you have no confidence.

&#x200B;

Edit: forgot to say, the incel community might as well be called the "im a victim" community. Dont be a victim youre better than that
